<title>POLAND: SOCCER-LEADING POLISH FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING POLISH FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Polish</p>
<p>first division after the weekend's matches:</p>
<p>13 - Cezary Kucharski (Legia Warszawa), Miroslaw Trzeciak (LKS</p>
<p>Lodz)</p>
<p>12 - Slawomir Wojciechowski (GKS Katowice)</p>
<p>11 - Mariusz Srutwa (Ruch Chorzow)</p>
<p>10 - Jacek Dembinski (Widzew Lodz), Bogdan Prusek (Sokol</p>
<p>Tychy/Amica Wronki), Piotr Reiss (Lech Poznan)</p>
<p>9 - Slawomir Majak (Widzew Lodz), Slawomir Suchomski (GKS</p>
<p>Belchatow).</p>
